# Common Package (`@lyterion/common`)

## Layout (target, per docs/architecture.md)

```
src/
  spotify/        client, export, GDPR export parser
  identity/       normalization, grouping, MusicBrainz, placement
  providers/      provider interface + one folder per provider
  verify/         decode, duration, fingerprint, spectral
  library/        tag, layout, place, m3u, navidrome client
  trigger/tasks/  one folder per task
  trigger/utils/  chunk + idempotency helpers
```

## Rules

- Services are plain functions taking explicit inputs, tasks are thin wrappers around them
- Anything touching the music library goes through `library/`, never raw fs calls in tasks (D-012)
- Provider code never decides ranking, it returns candidates (`docs/providers.md`)
